language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Bin packing: assign each item to one bin so that the total weight of the items in each bin does not exceed the bin capacity.
given weights_dim1 : int
letting n = weights_dim1
given weights : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int
given capacity : int
given num_bins : int
find bins : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int(0..num_bins-1)

branching on [bins]
such that
$ the total weight of the items assigned to each bin must not exceed the bin capacity
forAll b : int(0..num_bins-1) . (sum i : int(1..n) . (bins[i] = b) * weights[i]) <= capacity
